  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food security and adaptation to climate change in rural Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adressing food insecurity and malnutrition, the project aims to develop and implement a new participatory and farmer centered &quot;reserach for development&quot; approach. The aim is to increase economies and the food and nutrition security of rural households</narrative>
  </description>
